;; dir-runoff.expected.sexp — the expected observations for `dir-runoff.s` (P2-SCALAR.5, strand 3).
;; Validate with:
;;   python3 scripts/check_sexp_schema.py dir-runoff.expected.sexp schema/expectations.sexp

(comment "dir-runoff.expected.sexp — the expected observations for `dir-runoff.s`." "" "⛔ EVERY VALUE HERE WAS DERIVED FROM THE PINNED SPECIFICATION PROSE BEFORE THE PROGRAM WAS RUN" "(EVD-05), and the shape was MEASURED BY PROBE on all three models before authoring (P2-SCALAR.5" "strand 3, run_probes_p25s3.py): execution falls through the last assembled word; the fetch at" "entry+8 reads never-written in-region memory (zeros); 0x00000000 matches no decode row — a" "RESERVED encoding — and the laboratory's D-RESERVED-DECODE policy converts it to the" "illegal-instruction observation (cause 0x02, tval = the word = 0). Both references measured" "identical (sail spells the step `c.illegal`, spike `c.unimp`; tval 0 on both).")
(expectations (program "dir-runoff.s") (entry "0x80000000") (instructions 3) (step (n 0) (insn "addi x1, x0, 1") (writes (write (reg "x1") (value "0x0000000000000001"))) (derivation "The ordinary prefix: an immediate add, 0 + 1.") (source "RVI-RV32I §1.1.4")) (step (n 1) (insn "addi x2, x0, 2") (writes (write (reg "x2") (value "0x0000000000000002"))) (derivation "0 + 2.") (source "RVI-RV32I §1.1.4")) (step (n 2) (insn "(the zero word past the payload)") (writes ) (derivation "The program has no third word; sequential fetch reads the zeroed cell at entry+8 (D-FETCH-IMPLICIT, D-FETCH-MAP). 0x00000000 matches no row of the generated decode table — a RESERVED encoding, whose behavior the architecture leaves UNSPECIFIED; the laboratory's declared policy (D-RESERVED-DECODE) raises illegal-instruction with tval = the offending word: cause 0x02, tval 0x0000000000000000, and the run stops (Stop::Undefined keeps the source classification, SEM-07). Measured identical on both references by probe.") (source "RVI-RV32I §1.1.5.2 (the reserved-instruction note: UNSPECIFIED) — decision D-RESERVED-DECODE")))
